  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESTART IV &#x2013; Operational and Qualitative Support of the Austrian Return and Reintegration System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project RESTART IV aims to complement the existing national mechanisms in the field of assisted voluntary return and reintegration without duplicating them, by paying particular attention to returnees in vulnerable situations. The activities of the project are based on three pillars that complement each other: The first pillar aims at the operational and needs-based support of migrants in Austria through voluntary return and reintegration assistance to guarantee their safe, timely and dignified return and their sustainable reintegration. The second pillar focuses on quality assurance measures and thereby supports central stakeholders of the system with training and exchange opportunities. The third pillar serves to provide information in the form of outreach and communication activities, including the development of a website for AVRR.</narrative>
  </description>
